      "content": "i don't think i want to \"rebuild.\" everything feels so heavy and pointless. it's like i'm just waiting for the world to catch up to the fact that i've already stopped existing. what's even the point of trying to find a \"way to let the exhaustion settle\" if the exhaustion is all that's left?",
